2360:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****                  * Clear the cache. Cache may have residue of writes related to the previous
2361:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****                  * seg setup. These can endup being written back to DDR, so make sure cache
2362:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****                  * is flushed. The cache is flushed by reading 2MB from cached backed memory
