3588:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  *
3589:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * VREFDQ_calibration_using_mtc
3590:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * In order to write to mode registers, the E51 must use the INIT_* interface
3591:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * at the front end of the DDR controller,
3592:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * which is available via a series of control registers described in the DDR
3593:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  * CSR APB Register Map.
