3819:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * All bits set in this field mask corresponding bits in data fields
3820:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * i.e. mt_error and mt_error_hold will not be set for errors in
3821:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * those fields
3822:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     *
3823:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * Structure of 144 bits same as DFI bus
3824:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****     * 36 bits per lane ( 8 physical * 4) + (1ECC * 4) = 36
