4883:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  *
4884:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****  *  Example:
4885:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****       The call to
4886:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****       MSS_DDR_user_commands(USR_CMD_INC_DELAY_CYCLES_LINE, 0x01 , return_data)
4887:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****       will return 0 id successful and the
4888:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****       DDR type in the first four bytes of the ret_mem area.
4889:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_ddr.c ****       @code
